# theINmag

> Every page of theINmag is an idea by real Aussie kids: their art, writing, comics and photos, in print three times a year. It is ad-free and published in February, June and October. Print copies are posted within Australia around the 10th of the month and usually arrive around the 15th. The digital PDF edition is emailed within minutes of ordering.

## Who it is for

- Kids, designed for ages 5 to 13, who read it, make things for it and send IN their creations
- Parents who want a screen-free, ad-free read made by kids their child's age
- Gift-givers such as grandparents, aunts and uncles
- Teachers and schools looking for real kid writing and art to use in class
- Homeschool families who want rich, open tasks rather than worksheets

